# Manual drops. specs/00_TRADING_CONVENTIONS.md says these are git-ignored, but the
# `manual_settlements/` rule above never matched the real path the code uses
# (`pipelines/futures/client.py::MANUAL_FUTURES_DIR` is `data/manual/futures`), so
# nothing under data/manual/ was actually ignored.
data/manual/**/*.csv
!data/manual/**/.gitkeep
*.parquet
*.duckdb
data/raw/
data/lake/maps/

